# Notifications: port live-only inline reply to Omarchy4.5's key-based refs
# and Toast scene. Keep the4.5 store/deck engine and markup/security limits.
# Restored/dead senders cannot reply; one editor takes OnDemand keyboard
# focus and pauses expiry. A failed send preserves the draft. No app opens.

--- i/shell/plugins/notifications/Service.qml
